{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
Rotate the adamantoise on the
lower screen to control its
direction. Lift the stylus to send
the adamantoise into its shell,
making it impervious to damage.{00}

{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
Rotate the adamantoise on the
lower screen to control its
direction. Lift the stylus to send
the adamantoise into its shell,
increasing its speed.{00}

{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
Slide the chocobo to snatch as
many lasans as you can while
avoiding the falling fire and ice!{00}

{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
If the chocobo is frozen or
on fire, tap it quickly with the
stylus to remove the ailment.{00}

{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
Slide the chocobo to the
upper screen to snatch as
many luchiles as you can
while avoiding the fire!{00}

{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
Use the stylus to draw leaves
and launch the chocobo into
the air! Reach the top before
anybody else does!{00}

{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
Smaller leaves have more
elasticity than bigger ones.
Watch out for the bomb
monsters!{00}

{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
Use the stylus to draw leaves
and redirect the chocobo!
Bag as many coins as you can!{00}

{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
Leaves must be drawn
diagonally, or else the chocobo
will move straight through them.
Walk over ▲ to slow down or
▼ to speed up.{00}

{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
Move the magnifying glass by
sliding the stylus!
Find those fiery little
chocolings!{00}

{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
Once you've found a chocoling,
center the magnifying glass
above it.{00}

{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
The power of the spring's water
turns fire into gold! Try stealing
coins from opponents, too!{00}

{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
Control the chocobo by sliding
the stylus. Tap twice to initiate
a rolling attack. Use this to steal
coins from your opponents.{00}

{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
Listen carefully to the
musicians' magical melody!
Then be on the right panel
at the right time!{00}

{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
Tap the panels to move to the
appropriate instrument when
repeating the last tune.{00}

{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
Listen carefully to the
