the right panel.{00}

{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
Swim through the sea tunnel
while dodging any obstacles
that appear! Mess up three
times and you'll end up as
Leviathan's lunch!{00}

{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
Quickly slide the stylus up and
down to give the chocobo an
upwards boost. Lifting the stylus
from the touch screen will
cause the chocobo to sink.{00}

{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
Control the chocobo by sliding
the stylus. Tap twice to initiate
a rolling attack. Use this to steal
fish from your opponents.{00}

{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
Gather the scattered puzzle
pieces to build three different
houses! You'll receive a bonus
for completing a house.{00}

{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
Control the chocobo by sliding
the stylus. Land on a puzzle
piece to pick it up, then release
it over the house.{00}

{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
Run and hide to avoid the
Tonberries! Once you've
been spotted, they'll give chase!{00}

{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
Control the chocobo by sliding
the stylus. Tap twice to initiate
a rolling attack. Use this to
knock your opponents towards
the Tonberries.{00}

{1B}BRules{1B}{1B}
Complete the maze without
touching the electrified walls!
